title: "DAS-for-Urban-Monitoring: Optimal DAS interrogator placement on urban fiber-optic networks"
abstract: >-
  Code for optimal placement of Distributed Acoustic Sensing (DAS) interrogators
  on existing urban fiber-optic networks across three city-scale sensing tasks:
  traffic monitoring, earthquake early warning, and activity monitoring.
  Companion code for "Coverage regimes for urban monitoring with distributed
  acoustic sensing" (preprint arXiv:2606.17018).
